## Module 5: Dashboard Module

Developed a role-specific, dynamic, and secure dashboard experience for both employees and managers/admins/finance:

### 1. Backend Service & Direct-Report Aggregations
- **Direct-Reports Lookup**: Added `findByManagerId` to [users.service.ts](file:///d:/vibe%20code/spend-managment/project/backend/src/modules/users/users.service.ts) to resolve all accounts reporting to a manager.
- **Reports Expenses Fetching**: Added `findByUserIds` to [expenses.service.ts](file:///d:/vibe%20code/spend-managment/project/backend/src/modules/expenses/expenses.service.ts) to retrieve aggregated data for direct reports.
- **Dynamic Metrics Engine**: Refactored `getEmployeeMetrics` and `getManagerMetrics` in [dashboard.service.ts](file:///d:/vibe%20code/spend-managment/project/backend/src/modules/dashboard/dashboard.service.ts) to:
  - Aggregate approved spends (`total_spent` / `team_spent`) and pending reimbursement claims in real-time.
  - Track active policy violations.
  - Fetch and populates user profile details (submitter name and department) on manager dashboard recent tables.
- **Controller Binding**: Integrated the `@CurrentUser()` decorator on the manager statistics route in [dashboard.controller.ts](file:///d:/vibe%20code/spend-managment/project/backend/src/modules/dashboard/dashboard.controller.ts) to safely retrieve context-aware data.

### 2. High-Fidelity UI Redesign
- **Interactive Metrics Cards**: Created the layout matching the Stitch UI design (Screen ID `5fcbccf509eb4ddfa625c91f3ffeecd8`) inside [DashboardTab.tsx](file:///d:/vibe%20code/spend-managment/project/frontend/src/features/dashboard/DashboardTab.tsx) displaying:
  - **Awaiting review count** with glowing warning/pending indicators.
  - **Monthly approved totals** with trend badges.
  - **Policy Violation counts** requiring immediate attention.
- **Bento Widget Section**: Included the AI Insights card (including a functional redirect link to the Policy/Reporting tab) and the Equinox Premium promo visual.
- **Contextual Recent Submissions Table**:
  - Employee view displays personal submissions.
  - Manager/Admin view includes an additional **Employee Submitter** details column (populated with name and department) representing the team's live submissions.
  - Customized status badges to represent `Approved`, `Pending`, `Policy Violation`, and `Rejected` statuses.
- **Floating Action Button (FAB)**: Rendered a floating "New Expense" badge on the bottom-right for Employee roles to open the expense submission tab.

